    "updated_at": "2018-07-31T18:14:59Z",
    "body": "I was going to create a message on blink-dev and forgot to, but I went ahead and opened bugs for Blink, Firefox, Edge, and WebKit. Should I do any others and should I also still create a message on blink-dev as well?\r\n\r\nhttps://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=869480\r\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1479854\r\nhttps://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/issues/18470126/\r\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=188200",
