    "created_at": "2018-07-31T23:33:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-31T23:33:41Z",
    "body": "The proposal is almost same as [```<menuitem>```](https://www.w3.org/TR/html51/interactive-elements.html#the-menuitem-element), which we removed from the specification.\r\nBlink team's stance is that we should not provide complex UI features, and should provide primitives to help implementing such UI features instead.\r\n",
