    "created_at": "2021-04-30T03:54:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-30T03:54:13Z",
    "body": ">Blink team's stance\r\n\r\nJudging by the source code, Blink has been using native OS implementation of `select`'s dropdown menu in various OS for a long time, which was the *technical* reason why it couldn't accept any complex html in the past and *probably* nudged the team into supporting the restriction on the content in general...",
